{"id":48379,"date":"2026-01-27T06:03:00","date_gmt":"2026-01-27T05:03:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=48379"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:00:36","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:00:36","slug":"trail-e-caminhada-das-camelias","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-e-caminhada-das-camelias\/","title":{"rendered":"Caminhada e Trail das Cam\u00e9lias 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As&nbsp;<strong>Cam\u00e9lias<\/strong>&nbsp;s\u00e3o o s\u00edmbolo do concelho de&nbsp;<strong>Celorico de Basto<\/strong>&nbsp;e, por mais nomes que lhes sejam atribu\u00eddos, nenhum consegue descrever a sua&nbsp;<strong>beleza singular<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As suas caracter\u00edsticas \u00fanicas fizeram com que, ao longo do tempo, todas as casas \u2014 em especial as&nbsp;<strong>casas solarengas<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014 exibissem estas flores nos seus jardins e fachadas, com orgulho na sua&nbsp;<strong>vivacidade, cor e perfei\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vem connosco desfrutar de um&nbsp;<strong>trail e caminhada<\/strong>&nbsp;verdadeiramente id\u00edlicos, repletos de tradi\u00e7\u00e3o, natureza e encanto.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":48380,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48379","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-celorico-de-basto-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunn